  "notes": "Every raw field lives on its own 'Label: value' line in the Order Detail block, so near-anchor (same row, rightward) reaches every one of them without a table. `total_printed` carries the weight-tiered pricing chain (derive_price_per_foot) the same way a telecom persona's total_printed carries the F1 chain - the printed total is the vendor's own claim, real but not authoritative; the derivation decides what SPT is actually owed from the computed order weight, never from the invoice's own tier claim.",
